  "private": true,
  "description": "IRIX IDO 5.3 and 7.1 C compilers (cc, cfe, uopt, ugen, as1 and the other passes), statically recompiled by ido-static-recomp and bundled as WASM for romdev's N64 matching-decompilation domain.",
